{"t":"ASTS","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc.","ko":"AST스페이스모바일","sector":"Technology","industry":"Communication Equipment","employees":1126,"hq":"Midland, TX, United States","website":"https://ast-science.com","summary_en":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, designs and develops the constellation of BlueBird satellites in the United States. The company provides a cellular broadband network in space to be accessible directly by smartphones for commercial use and other applications, as well as for government use. Its SpaceMobile service provides cellular broadband services to end-users who are out of terrestrial cellular coverage. The company was founded in 2017 and is headquartered in Midland, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"AST SpaceMobile, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국에서 BlueBird 위성군을 설계하고 개발합니다. 이 회사는 상업용 및 기타 애플리케이션은 물론 정부 용도로 스마트폰으로 직접 액세스할 수 있는 셀룰러 광대역 네트워크를 우주에 제공합니다. SpaceMobile 서비스는 지상파 셀룰러 서비스 범위를 벗어난 최종 사용자에게 셀룰러 광대역 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 2017년에 설립되었으며 텍사스 주 미들랜드에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":31.725,"mcap":12376228864.0,"pe":null,"fpe":-20.320126,"peg":null,"ps":86.61974,"pb":5.5231547,"ev_ebitda":-25.118,"div":0.0,"beta":2.847,"hi52":133.86,"lo52":27.58},"fin":{"rev":142880000.0,"rev_g":1.871,"eps_g":null,"gross":0.3705,"op":-3.93346,"net":0.0,"roe":-0.43232,"fcf":-1892670592.0,"cash":2798910976.0,"debt":4118731008.0,"de":190.454,"eps":-2.12,"feps":-1.56126},"own":{"short":0.22540002,"inst":0.53927,"insider":0.079840004},"analyst":{"n":12,"mean":63.35,"median":51.85,"high":108.0,"low":39.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.53846,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":1,"buy":4,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":1,"buy":4,"hold":6,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":1,"buy":4,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":1,"buy":3,"hold":7,"sell":1,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-10","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Neutra